{"3172570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Extreme Forklifting 3", "steam_appid": 3172570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the superhuman skill and bravery of a certified forklift operator!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a well kept secret that many forklift operators are actually giraffes, now YOU can experience the thrilling life of a warehouse giraffe! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On wheels or hoofs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/96c6f065f7e05452fd7e266787b11545.poster.avif?t=1780298654\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/96c6f065f7e05452fd7e266787b11545.webm?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/96c6f065f7e05452fd7e266787b11545.mp4?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Forklifting 3 is a level based, third-person driving game with some light platforming when on hoof.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your forklift to deliver pallets to their destination, build bridges and traverse dangerous obstacles, in the warehouse anything could happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in giraffe-form you switch between forklifts, jump over gaps and operate equipment such as conveyor belts and levers.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the latest in giraffe warehouse fashion. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/c4145962269ad6544b89fb8aa38819a7.poster.avif?t=1780298654\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/c4145962269ad6544b89fb8aa38819a7.webm?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/c4145962269ad6544b89fb8aa38819a7.mp4?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your forklifts, pallet jacks and create your dream giraffe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your pallet moving beauty with stickers, spoilers or cool rims. Give your giraffe that fashionable scarf that matches the brick walls perfectly!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/d2ba7d45de9293f20a23636d387927ba.poster.avif?t=1780298654\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/d2ba7d45de9293f20a23636d387927ba.webm?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/d2ba7d45de9293f20a23636d387927ba.mp4?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a nimble 3-wheel electric forklift, or for the heavier loads, use a 4-wheel propane or diesel truck. And when those aren't available, you’ll have to make do with the good old pallet jack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Forklifting 3, the game you never knew you wanted!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the superhuman skill and bravery of a certified forklift operator!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a well kept secret that many forklift operators are actually giraffes, now YOU can experience the thrilling life of a warehouse giraffe! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On wheels or hoofs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/96c6f065f7e05452fd7e266787b11545.poster.avif?t=1780298654\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/96c6f065f7e05452fd7e266787b11545.webm?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/96c6f065f7e05452fd7e266787b11545.mp4?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Forklifting 3 is a level based, third-person driving game with some light platforming when on hoof.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your forklift to deliver pallets to their destination, build bridges and traverse dangerous obstacles, in the warehouse anything could happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in giraffe-form you switch between forklifts, jump over gaps and operate equipment such as conveyor belts and levers.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the latest in giraffe warehouse fashion. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/c4145962269ad6544b89fb8aa38819a7.poster.avif?t=1780298654\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/c4145962269ad6544b89fb8aa38819a7.webm?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/c4145962269ad6544b89fb8aa38819a7.mp4?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your forklifts, pallet jacks and create your dream giraffe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your pallet moving beauty with stickers, spoilers or cool rims. Give your giraffe that fashionable scarf that matches the brick walls perfectly!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/d2ba7d45de9293f20a23636d387927ba.poster.avif?t=1780298654\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/d2ba7d45de9293f20a23636d387927ba.webm?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/extras/d2ba7d45de9293f20a23636d387927ba.mp4?t=1780298654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a nimble 3-wheel electric forklift, or for the heavier loads, use a 4-wheel propane or diesel truck. And when those aren't available, you’ll have to make do with the good old pallet jack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Forklifting 3, the game you never knew you wanted!</p>", "short_description": "Live the dream as a forklift operator! Experience the thrilling life of a warehouse giraffe! Use your trusty forklifts to solve problems and deliver pallets in this 3D vehicular platformer.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/c6daff139d0f9f3bc0b2caf90d129ae4d9b7ad5b/header.jpg?t=1780298654", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/ac0a742dc4bbaa59895df84c3227098fb446a744/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780298654", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/ac0a742dc4bbaa59895df84c3227098fb446a744/capsul